<html>
<body>
    <h2>Reset Your Password</h2>
    <div class="headerimage">
        <img src="https://www.dropbox.com/s/omuane2didx7rh0/DeceptionPassBridgeInFogHeader.jpg?raw=1" alt="Bridging the space between imagination and implementation..." style="max-height:100%; max-width:100%">
    </div>
    <p>Hello {{TargetUser.UserName}},</p>
    <p>You recently requested to reset your password for your JCarrollOnline account.</p>
    <p>Please click the button below to reset your password:</p>
    <p><a href="{{CallbackUrl}}" style="background-color: #4CAF50; color: white; padding: 14px 20px; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; border-radius: 4px;">Reset Password</a></p>
    <p>If the button doesn't work, copy and paste this link into your browser:</p>
    <p>{{CallbackUrl}}</p>
    <p>If you didn't request a password reset, please ignore this email.</p>
    <p>Thanks,<br />The JCarrollOnline Team</p>
</body>
</html>